Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: add an explicit Q1000K PON consumer transport

Keep QDMA ownership in the Ethernet driver, pass PON descriptor metadata
explicitly, and deliver raw frames before Ethernet parsing/GRO/PPE. Detach
and drain packet callbacks under RTNL/RCU; retain no lower-netdev reference
that could block unregister. Q1000K GDM2 remains disabled in the board DTS.
The vendor hook adapter and physical PON lifecycle are separate work.

